OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to axe all lollipop crossings
OL,4,Ain major cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorcestershire's school crossing patrol
OL,7,Fservice may close in order to save
OL,8,F#69,000 a year, while also potentially
OL,9,Fleading to compulsory redundancies.
OL,11,FThe news comes after the number of
OL,12,Fpatrols has fallen from 93 in 2013, to
OL,13,F23, five sites of which currently have
OL,14,Fa staff vacancy.
OL,16,FAn alternative option under the
OL,17,Fproposals, which are part of a wider
OL,18,Fcounty council review of discretionary
OL,19,Fservices, would allow schools or
OL,20,Fcommunity groups to sponsor patrols
OL,21,Fthrough full-cost funding agreements.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
