OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to axe all lollipop crossings
OL,4,Ain major cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe county council would continue to
OL,7,Femploy, train and manage patrol staff,
OL,8,Fbut charges would cover more than
OL,9,Fsalaries alone. The authority wants
OL,10,Fcouncillors to approve a public
OL,11,Fconsultation on the issues.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
